@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Cadastro Completo de Atleta (Player) — Cria automaticamente o perfil na tabela players, salva senha em Argon2i e emite Sessão Única (12h)
# @name registerPlayer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Arturo",
  "last_name": "Coello",
  "age": 22,
  "cpf": "529.982.247-25",
  "email": "arturo.{{$guid}}@playerscout.test",
  "whatsapp_phone": "(51) 99888-7766",
  "cep": "90570-020",
  "street": "Rua Padre Chagas",
  "street_number": "320",
  "complement": "Apto 402",
  "neighborhood": "Moinhos de Vento",
  "city": "Porto Alegre",
  "state": "RS",
  "role": "player",
  "preferred_side": "right",
  "dominant_hand": "left_handed",
  "password": "PadelKing2026!@"
}

### 2. Cadastro Completo de Treinador (Coach) — Posição Esquerda (Revés) e sem complemento
# @name registerCoach
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Gustavo",
  "last_name": "Pratto",
  "age": 46,
  "cpf": "11144477735",
  "email": "pratto.{{$guid}}@playerscout.test",
  "whatsapp_phone": "(11) 97777-6655",
  "cep": "01310-100",
  "street": "Av. Paulista",
  "street_number": "1500",
  "complement": "",
  "neighborhood": "Bela Vista",
  "city": "São Paulo",
  "state": "SP",
  "role": "coach",
  "preferred_side": "left",
  "dominant_hand": "right_handed",
  "password": "CoachMaster2026$%"
}

### 3. Login Exclusivo por E-mail (Verificação de Hash Argon2i + Emissão de Sessão Única de 12h)
# @name loginPlayer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{registerPlayer.response.body.user.email}}",
  "password": "PadelKing2026!@"
}

### 3.1. Inspeção da Sessão Ativa (12h) do Usuário Autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/session
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPlayer.response.body.session_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Busca de Usuário pela Chave Única CPF (Restrito a Coach/Admin — LGPD)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/lookup?cpf=529.982.247-25
Authorization: Bearer {{registerCoach.response.body.session_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Busca de Usuário pela Chave Única E-mail (Restrito a Coach/Admin — LGPD)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/lookup?email={{registerPlayer.response.body.user.email}}
Authorization: Bearer {{registerCoach.response.body.session_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. OAuth2: Obter URL de Autorização do Google (Gmail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/oauth/google/authorize
Accept: application/json

### 7. OAuth2: Obter URL de Autorização do Microsoft Office
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/oauth/microsoft/authorize
Accept: application/json

### 8. OAuth2: Obter URL de Autorização do Instagram
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/oauth/instagram/authorize
Accept: application/json

### 9. OAuth2: Callback / Vínculo de Conta Social ao Usuário Autenticado
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/oauth/google/callback
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPlayer.response.body.session_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{registerPlayer.response.body.user.id}}",
  "provider_user_id": "google-oauth2-{{$guid}}",
  "provider_email": "{{registerPlayer.response.body.user.email}}"
}

### 10. Telas Web SSR de Login e Cadastro Completo
GET {{baseUrl}}/web/login
Accept: text/html

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/web/register
Accept: text/html

